[Unit]
Description=Dunking Sheep watchdog dead-man check (independent of the watchdog)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
# Reads only the heartbeat; never the watchdog config or rules. 3 x the
# watchdog's 10-minute cadence; at most one VP alert per hour while stale.
# The cadence is hard-coded here DELIBERATELY: the dead-man must not read the
# watchdog config (it has to work when that config is broken). If
# cadence_minutes in watchdog.json changes, change --cadence-minutes here too.
ExecStart=/home/hunter/.local/bin/dunkingsheep --no-start-daemon watchdog-deadman --cadence-minutes 10 --multiplier 3 --cooldown-minutes 60 --to "vp of agentry"
